	(text "Kelvin source (pin 3) of each device returns to its own driver COM (gate-drive sheet).\nEach tab on its own AlN ceramic (aluminium nitride) pad (P...: basic insulation HV-PE, IC-07; spec in the BOM). LAYOUT (IC-22):\nmilled slot between drain pin 1 and pins 2-4. SYMMETRY: equal drain/source busbar paths per switch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 137.932 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0099633d-8521-5635-bb84-c5c53e9a547a")
	)
	(text "3 x C4AQUBU4220A1YJ at the S3/S4 pins: commutation loop cap-top-bottom <= 20 nH, bulk bank <= 15 nH from the\nleg (LAYOUT REQUIREMENTS, leg deck). Damper (PVR-02): 3.75 W normal / 5.68 W trip corner per leg into\n2 x 3 CRCW2512-HP (7.4 W rated at 85 C, 500 V); damper loop at the device pins <= 3 nH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 262.92 151.684 0)
		(effects
